  "notes": [
    "J501 A6/B6 share USB_DP_PORT; A7/B7 share USB_DM_PORT. Native same-name wires provide the electrical join while avoiding misleading crossed A/B lines.",
    "J501 A8/B8 remain intentional NC. All four native shell pins 1/2/3/4 explicitly join GND; A1/A12/B1/B12 are also GND.",
    "Data ESD inputs connect directly to the USB-side of R503/R504. C501/C502 are visibly connected only on MCU-side data nets and remain DNP with no selected value.",
    "U502 and both 5.1k CC pull-downs are directly wired into the same local networks.",
    "D501 native pin1 cathode remains USB_5V_PROTECTED; pin2 anode remains GND.",
    "J502 pin1=USB_5V_PROTECTED, pin2=VIN_5V, pin3=BENCH_5V. This is a selector header, no implicit closed jumper is drawn.",
    "Do not change component MPNs, footprint selections, BOM DNP state or charging behavior. Native attribute positions still require export visual review."
  ]
}
